            {
              "id": "de3bc4fc-8e4c-4b72-9795-edbfcde0e17e",
              "type": "paragraph",
              "html": "<em><strong>Serious Games</strong></em> was written by by Clark C. Abt, originally published by The Viking Press, March 6, 1970."
            },
            {
              "id": "276ef7e0-0d55-44f5-b1e7-0b615d50be36",
              "type": "paragraph",
              "html": ""
            },
            {
              "id": "a7c86803-d4d0-4f30-8da5-f372edc4e488",
              "type": "quote",
              "html": "<em>The author explores the ways in which games can be used to instruct and inform as well as provide pleasure. He uses innovative approaches to problem solving through individualized game techniques.</em>"
            },
